Source: phi-runtime
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, pkgconf, libmosquitto-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/phi-systems-tech/phi-runtime

Package: libphi-runtime0
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: PHI runtime library
 The event loop the phi daemons and their plugins share: epoll-driven
 loops, loop-owning threads, cross-thread posts and bounded queues.
 One dynamic library on purpose, so a Loop reference handed across a
 plugin boundary means the same loop state on every side.

Package: libphi-runtime-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libphi-runtime0 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: PHI runtime library development files
 Headers and CMake config for building against the phi runtime.

Package: libphi-runtime-mqtt0
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: PHI runtime MQTT client
 An MQTT client driven by the phi runtime loop: libmosquitto on the
 loop's thread, with TLS, a last will and disconnect reasons a person
 can read. A library of its own, so only what talks to a broker pulls
 in libmosquitto.

Package: libphi-runtime-mqtt-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libphi-runtime-mqtt0 (= ${binary:Version}), libphi-runtime-dev (= ${binary:Version})
Description: PHI runtime MQTT client development files
 Header (phi/runtime/mqtt/client.h) and CMake config
 (find_package(phi-runtime-mqtt), target phi::runtime_mqtt).
